WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
HIV prevention for women: is an injection every 8 weeks better than a daily pill?

2
00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:09.500
HPTN 084 enrolled 3224 participants women at 20 sites in sub-Saharan Africa.

3
00:00:09.500 --> 00:00:15.500
Hazard ratio 0.12: cabotegravir was superior.

4
00:00:15.500 --> 00:00:21.500
Infections: 4 with cabotegravir, 36 with daily pills.

5
00:00:21.500 --> 00:00:27.500
The reason: only 42.1% of pill-group samples showed daily use. Injection coverage was 93%.

6
00:00:27.500 --> 00:00:33.500
Injectable cabotegravir was superior to daily PrEP. The Lancet, 2022. Scroll for the full breakdown.
